{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In some computer languages (such as APL), when there are no parentheses in an algebraic expression, the operations are grouped from right to left. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef060fc8529c9d610e0c4e7ef956eb9dd0a37894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\times b - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" /> in such languages means the same as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2beb530ca33430fc3f9801ed5bd40070d78c7bcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(b-c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> in ordinary algebraic notation. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/c/6ec232e734574b283a549a92eac65a2c9e68e5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\div b-c+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> is evaluated in such a language, the result in ordinary algebraic notation would be\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/1/d51e7cb75e6951e65c035bcadb3aef2c5e8baff3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } \\frac{a}{b}-c+d \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{a}{b}-c-d \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{d+c-b}{a} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\frac{a}{b-c+d} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\frac{a}{b-c-d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"667\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The rightmost part of the expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd54f8129186e28453c8c19f0c38ca25420a8e9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e00832369dc5c668ba5a6dee10b7bd6657e47df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-c+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"16\" /> would be grouped as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3daaf31b0f20f7eff5350f8976e6492af313261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-(c+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />, and thus the whole expression would be grouped as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/2261f4bc641279ab6459d9333a0453fc8a9af57b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\div (b-(c+d)) = \\boxed{\\text{(E)} \\ \\frac{a}{b-c-d}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"270\" height=\"47\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/